# Screens

Each screen is `src/Pages/{PascalName}/index.tsx` + `styles.tsx`. Default-export the page. Register it in `src/Routes`.

New or refactored screens:

- `index.tsx` — wire hooks/callbacks and render UI (keep Firestore out of new UI).
- Optional `use-{feature}.ts` in `src/hooks/` or beside the page if only that page uses it.
- Optional `src/services/{feature}-service.ts` for Auth/Firestore.
- Page-only widgets: `src/Pages/{Name}/_components/` in kebab-case (`date-nav.tsx`).
- Shared widgets: `src/Components`.

```tsx
// ✅ Page default export
export default function Tarefas() { /* ... */ }

// ❌ Do not add Expo Router `app/` files
```

Reuse existing date navigation (prev / today / next) instead of duplicating ad-hoc calendars. Match dark theme tokens already used in sibling `styles.tsx`.
